# RU DNS bypass extra domains (user-editable).
# When DoT is enabled, dnsmasq forwards queries for these domains — and for all
# .ru / .su / .xn--p1ai (.рф) TLDs (built in) — directly to Yandex DNS
# (77.88.8.8 / 77.88.8.1), bypassing stubby/DoH.
#
# Rationale: stubby egresses via the VPN tunnel, so without this bypass the DoT
# provider sees a foreign exit IP and returns far CDN nodes for RU sites
# (confirmed live: static.avito.ru resolved to a 12×-slower node).
#
# Add only non-RU-TLD RU services here — ru/su/xn--p1ai are already built in.
# One domain per line. Lines starting with # are comments. Leading dots are
# stripped automatically. This file is seeded on first install only; an existing
# device keeps its own runtime copy unchanged on upgrade.
avito.st
vk.com
userapi.com
mycdn.me
yastatic.net
yandex.net
ya.ru
wbstatic.net
